            <ArticleTitle>Sclerosing peritonitis and practolol therapy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>473-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The case is described of a patient who presented with the characteristic symptoms and signs of sclerosing peritonitis due to practolol therapy. The clinical features, operative findings, and management are discussed.</AbstractText>
